  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "I noticed this problem when doing some optimization the search tables with a repo with 1.5 million object.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "It appears that a simple read operation such as",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "curl -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://localhost:8080/rest/"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://localhost:8080/rest/",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "passes a transaction id to the containment index which in turn causes it to use ContainmentIndexImpl.SELECT_CHILDREN_IN_TRANSACTION  which is much slower than the lighter weight  ContainmentIndexImpl.SELECT_CHILDREN which is used when the transaction id is null.  Since we're always using a transaction, we are always using the more complicated and slower query. ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "****",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": " ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "So here’s the performance on the first query (SELECT_CHILDREN):  .28 ms",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "fedora=> explain analyze SELECT fedora_id FROM containment WHERE parent = 'info:fedora' AND end_time IS NULL ORDER BY fedora_id LIMIT 100 OFFSET 0;",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "QUERY PLAN",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Limit (cost=0.55..12.32 rows=100 width=48) (actual time=0.029..0.240 rows=100 loops=1)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "-> Index Scan using containment_pkey on containment (cost=0.55..185605.24 rows=1576596 width=48) (actual time=0.028..0.200 rows=100 loops=1)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Filter: ((end_time IS NULL) AND ((parent)::text = 'info:fedora'::text))",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Planning Time: 0.148 ms",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Execution Time: 0.280 ms",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "(5 rows)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "(edited)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": " ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://fedora-project.slack.com/archives/CM74BAYS3/p1618373815290400"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "9:16",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Here’s the query produce by  SELECT_CHILDREN_IN_TRANSACTION",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "fedora=> explain analyze SELECT x.fedora_id FROM (SELECT fedora_id FROM containment WHERE parent = 'info:fedora' AND end_time IS NULL UNION SELECT fedora_id FROM containment_transactions WHERE parent = 'info:fedora' AND transaction_id = 'x' AND operation = 'add') x WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM containment_transactions WHERE parent = 'info:fedora' AND fedora_id = x.fedora_id AND transaction_id = 'x' AND operation IN ('delete', 'purge')) ORDER BY x.fedora_id LIMIT 100 OFFSET 0",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": ";",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "QUERY PLAN-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "-----------------------------\r",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Limit (cost=958591.18..958592.94 rows=100 width=516) (actual time=21888.321..21888.767 rows=100 loops=1)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "-> Merge Anti Join (cost=958591.18..986210.31 rows=1573730 width=516) (actual time=21888.319..21888.723 rows=100 loops=1)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Merge Cond: ((containment.fedora_id)::text = (containment_transactions.fedora_id)::text)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "-> Unique (cost=958583.00..966465.99 rows=1576597 width=516) (actual time=21888.273..21888.635 rows=100 loops=1)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "-> Sort (cost=958583.00..962524.49 rows=1576597 width=516) (actual time=21888.270..21888.577 rows=100 loops=1)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Sort Key: containment.fedora_id",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Sort Method: external merge Disk: 91104kB",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "-> Append (cost=0.00..63413.09 rows=1576597 width=516) (actual time=0.016..1154.568 rows=1577478 loops=1)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "-> Seq Scan on containment (cost=0.00..39755.96 rows=1576596 width=48) (actual time=0.015..566.892 rows=1577478 loops=1)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Filter: ((end_time IS NULL) AND ((parent)::text = 'info:fedora'::text))",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Rows Removed by Filter: 3152",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "-> Index Scan using containment_transactions_idx3 on containment_transactions containment_transactions_1 (cost=0.15..8.17 rows=1 width=49) (actual time=",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "0.017..0.017 rows=0 loops=1)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Index Cond: ((transaction_id)::text = 'x'::text)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Filter: (((parent)::text = 'info:fedora'::text) AND ((operation)::text = 'add'::text))",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "-> Sort (cost=8.18..8.19 rows=1 width=49) (actual time=0.039..0.040 rows=0 loops=1)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Sort Key: containment_transactions.fedora_id",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Sort Method: quicksort Memory: 25kB",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "-> Index Scan using containment_transactions_idx3 on containment_transactions (cost=0.15..8.17 rows=1 width=49) (actual time=0.025..0.025 rows=0 loops=1)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Index Cond: ((transaction_id)::text = 'x'::text)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Filter: (((operation)::text = ANY ('{delete,purge}'::text[])) AND ((parent)::text = 'info:fedora'::text))",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Planning Time: 0.378 ms",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Execution Time: 21905.394 ms",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "(22 rows)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": " ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Notice the second query takes 75,000 times longer  (21,095 ms / 0.28 = 75,339).  ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
