  "description": "<p>I noticed this problem when doing some optimization the search tables with a repo with 1.5 million object.</p>\n\n<p>It appears that a simple read operation such as<br/>\n curl -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/</a><br/>\n passes a transaction id to the containment index which in turn causes it to use ContainmentIndexImpl.SELECT_CHILDREN_IN_TRANSACTION  which is much slower than the lighter weight  ContainmentIndexImpl.SELECT_CHILDREN which is used when the transaction id is null.  Since we're always using a transaction, we are always using the more complicated and slower query. </p>\n\n<p>****<br/>\n  <br/>\n So here’s the performance on the first query (SELECT_CHILDREN):  .28 ms<br/>\n fedora=&gt; explain analyze SELECT fedora_id FROM containment WHERE parent = 'info:fedora' AND end_time IS NULL ORDER BY fedora_id LIMIT 100 OFFSET 0;<br/>\n QUERY PLAN<br/>\n --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br/>\n Limit (cost=0.55..12.32 rows=100 width=48) (actual time=0.029..0.240 rows=100 loops=1)<br/>\n -&gt; Index Scan using containment_pkey on containment (cost=0.55..185605.24 rows=1576596 width=48) (actual time=0.028..0.200 rows=100 loops=1)<br/>\n Filter: ((end_time IS NULL) AND ((parent)::text = 'info:fedora'::text))<br/>\n Planning Time: 0.148 ms<br/>\n Execution Time: 0.280 ms<br/>\n (5 rows)<br/>\n (edited)<br/>\n  <br/>\n <a href=\"https://fedora-project.slack.com/archives/CM74BAYS3/p1618373815290400\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">9:16</a><br/>\n Here’s the query produce by  SELECT_CHILDREN_IN_TRANSACTION<br/>\n fedora=&gt; explain analyze SELECT x.fedora_id FROM (SELECT fedora_id FROM containment WHERE parent = 'info:fedora' AND end_time IS NULL UNION SELECT fedora_id FROM containment_transactions WHERE parent = 'info:fedora' AND transaction_id = 'x' AND operation = 'add') x WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM containment_transactions WHERE parent = 'info:fedora' AND fedora_id = x.fedora_id AND transaction_id = 'x' AND operation IN ('delete', 'purge')) ORDER BY x.fedora_id LIMIT 100 OFFSET 0<br/>\n ;<br/>\n QUERY PLAN-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br/>\n -----------------------------<br/>\n Limit (cost=958591.18..958592.94 rows=100 width=516) (actual time=21888.321..21888.767 rows=100 loops=1)<br/>\n -&gt; Merge Anti Join (cost=958591.18..986210.31 rows=1573730 width=516) (actual time=21888.319..21888.723 rows=100 loops=1)<br/>\n Merge Cond: ((containment.fedora_id)::text = (containment_transactions.fedora_id)::text)<br/>\n -&gt; Unique (cost=958583.00..966465.99 rows=1576597 width=516) (actual time=21888.273..21888.635 rows=100 loops=1)<br/>\n -&gt; Sort (cost=958583.00..962524.49 rows=1576597 width=516) (actual time=21888.270..21888.577 rows=100 loops=1)<br/>\n Sort Key: containment.fedora_id<br/>\n Sort Method: external merge Disk: 91104kB<br/>\n -&gt; Append (cost=0.00..63413.09 rows=1576597 width=516) (actual time=0.016..1154.568 rows=1577478 loops=1)<br/>\n -&gt; Seq Scan on containment (cost=0.00..39755.96 rows=1576596 width=48) (actual time=0.015..566.892 rows=1577478 loops=1)<br/>\n Filter: ((end_time IS NULL) AND ((parent)::text = 'info:fedora'::text))<br/>\n Rows Removed by Filter: 3152<br/>\n -&gt; Index Scan using containment_transactions_idx3 on containment_transactions containment_transactions_1 (cost=0.15..8.17 rows=1 width=49) (actual time=<br/>\n 0.017..0.017 rows=0 loops=1)<br/>\n Index Cond: ((transaction_id)::text = 'x'::text)<br/>\n Filter: (((parent)::text = 'info:fedora'::text) AND ((operation)::text = 'add'::text))<br/>\n -&gt; Sort (cost=8.18..8.19 rows=1 width=49) (actual time=0.039..0.040 rows=0 loops=1)<br/>\n Sort Key: containment_transactions.fedora_id<br/>\n Sort Method: quicksort Memory: 25kB<br/>\n -&gt; Index Scan using containment_transactions_idx3 on containment_transactions (cost=0.15..8.17 rows=1 width=49) (actual time=0.025..0.025 rows=0 loops=1)<br/>\n Index Cond: ((transaction_id)::text = 'x'::text)<br/>\n Filter: (((operation)::text = ANY ('{delete,purge}'::text[])) AND ((parent)::text = 'info:fedora'::text))<br/>\n Planning Time: 0.378 ms<br/>\n Execution Time: 21905.394 ms<br/>\n (22 rows)<br/>\n  <br/>\n Notice the second query takes 75,000 times longer  (21,095 ms / 0.28 = 75,339).  </p>",
